<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>VIVA ARRACHERAS | Premium Grill & Cuts - CDMX</title>
    <!-- FontAwesome para iconos -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@500;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-main: #0c0d0e;
            --bg-card: #16181a;
            --bg-card-hover: #1f2226;
            --primary-orange: #ff3c00;
            --primary-red: #e62200;
            --accent-yellow: #ffb703;
            --text-white: #ffffff;
            --text-gray: #9ba3af;
            --border-color: #26292e;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-main);
            color: var(--text-white);
            line-height: 1.5;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* --- NAV HEADER --- */
        header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(12, 13, 14, 0.92);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            padding: 15px 5%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            z-index: 1000;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .logo i {
            color: var(--primary-orange);
            font-size: 1.4rem;
        }

        nav ul {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
            gap: 25px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: var(--text-gray);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover, nav a.active {
            color: var(--text-white);
        }

        .nav-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .btn-header-reserva {
            background: #1e2024;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px 18px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .btn-header-pedido {
            background: var(--primary-orange);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px 18px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        /* --- HERO SECTION --- */
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 120px 20px 60px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(12,13,14,0.6) 0%, rgba(12,13,14,1) 100%), 
                        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555939594-58d7cb561ad1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
            position: relative;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            color: var(--primary-orange);
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
            font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 10vw, 7.5rem);
            line-height: 0.9;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .hero-title span {
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--primary-orange), #ff6b00);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            display: block;
        }

        .hero-tagline {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            margin-bottom: 35px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .btn-orange {
            background: var(--primary-orange);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition: transform 0.2s, background 0.3s;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn-orange:hover {
            background: var(--primary-red);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .btn-outline {
            background: rgba(22, 24, 26, 0.8);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition: border-color 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            border-color: var(--primary-orange);
        }

        /* --- MENU SECTION --- */
        .menu-section {
            padding: 80px 5%;
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .section-tag {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--primary-orange);
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .section-main-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .search-box {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .search-box input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 16px 20px 16px 50px;
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 8px;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            outline: none;
        }

        .search-box i {
            position: absolute;
            left: 20px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            color: var(--text-gray);
        }

        /* Category Filter Tabs */
        .category-tabs {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            overflow-x: auto;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            scrollbar-width: thin;
        }

        .tab-btn {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: var(--text-gray);
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            white-space: nowrap;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .tab-btn.active, .tab-btn:hover {
            background: var(--primary-orange);
            color: #fff;
            border-color: var(--primary-orange);
        }

        /* Menu Category Block */
        .category-block {
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .category-header {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .category-title {
            font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .category-desc {
            color: var(--text-gray);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        .dishes-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(380px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .dish-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 22px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 15px;
            transition: background 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
        }

        .dish-card:hover {
            background: var(--bg-card-hover);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        .dish-info h4 {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .dish-info h4 i {
            color: var(--primary-orange);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .dish-info p {
            color: var(--text-gray);
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .dish-price {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--primary-orange);
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        /* --- EXPERIENCIA SECTION --- */
        .experiencia {
            padding: 100px 5%;
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 60px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .experiencia-img {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .experiencia-content .section-tag {
            text-align: left;
        }

        .experiencia-title {
            font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
            font-size: 3rem;
            line-height: 1.1;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .experiencia-desc {
            color: var(--text-gray);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .metrics-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-top: 30px;
        }

        .metric-num {
            font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--primary-orange);
        }

        .metric-label {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        /* --- RESERVA BANNER --- */
        .reserva-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(12,13,14,0.85), rgba(12,13,14,0.85)),
                        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544025162-d76694265947?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80') center/cover;
            padding: 100px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-y: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .reserva-banner h2 {
            font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
            font-size: 3.2rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .reserva-banner p {
            color: var(--text-gray);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        /* --- VOCES / RESEÑAS --- */
        .reviews-section {
            padding: 100px 5%;
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .reviews-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 80px;
        }

        .review-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 25px;
        }

        .review-author {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .avatar {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            background: var(--primary-orange);
            color: #fff;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .author-info h5 {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .author-info span {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .review-card p {
            color: var(--text-gray);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        /* --- FORMULARIO RESEÑA --- */
        .review-form-container {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 40px;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .form-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .form-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .form-group label {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .form-group input, .form-group select, .form-group textarea {
            background: var(--bg-main);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 14px;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            outline: none;
        }

        .rating-stars {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            color: var(--primary-orange);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        /* --- UBICACIÓN --- */
        .ubicacion-section {
            padding: 100px 5%;
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
            gap: 40px;
        }

        .location-info h2 {
            font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
            font-size: 3rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .address-box {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .address-box p {
            color: var(--text-gray);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .map-placeholder {
            width: 100%;
            height: 350px;
            background: #1e2024;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .map-placeholder iframe {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            border: 0;
            filter: grayscale(100%) invert(90%);
        }

        /* --- FOOTER --- */
        footer {
            background: #080809;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 60px 5% 30px;
        }

        .footer-grid {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        .footer-brand .logo {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .footer-brand p {
            color: var(--text-gray);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            max-width: 300px;
        }

        .footer-col h5 {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .footer-col p, .footer-col a {
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .social-icons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .social-icons a {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #fff;
            transition: border-color 0.3s;
        }

        .social-icons a:hover {
            border-color: var(--primary-orange);
            color: var(--primary-orange);
        }

        .footer-bottom {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-top: 25px;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
        }

        /* Floating WhatsApp Button */
        .whatsapp-btn {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 30px;
            right: 30px;
            width: 55px;
            height: 55px;
            background: #25d366;
            color: #fff;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
            text-decoration: none;
            z-index: 1000;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .whatsapp-btn:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            nav { display: none; }
            .experiencia { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .ubicacion-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
            .form-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .dishes-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header / Nav -->
    <header>
        <a href="#" class="logo">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-fire-flame-curved"></i>
            VIVA
        </a>
        <nav>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#menu" class="active">MENÚ</a></li>
                <li><a href="#reserva">RESERVA</a></li>
                <li><a href="#opina">OPINA</a></li>
                <li><a href="#ubicacion">UBICACIÓN</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
        <div class="nav-actions">
            <a href="#reserva" class="btn-header-reserva"><i class="fa-regular fa-calendar"></i> RESERVAR</a>
            <a href="#menu" class="btn-header-pedido"><i class="fa-solid fa-utensils"></i> PEDIDO</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-subtitle">// PREMIUM GRILL & CUTS - CDMX //</div>
        <h1 class="hero-title">
            VIVA
            <span>ARRACHERAS</span>
        </h1>
        <div class="hero-tagline">// SABOR QUE SE COMPARTE //</div>
        <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="#menu" class="btn-orange">VER EL MENÚ</a>
            <a href="#reserva" class="btn-outline">RESERVAR MESA</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Menu Section -->
    <section id="menu" class="menu-section">
        <div class="section-tag">// LA CARTA COMPLETA //</div>
        <h2 class="section-main-title">EL MENÚ</h2>

        <!-- Search input -->
        <div class="search-box">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass"></i>
            <input type="text" id="menuSearch" placeholder="Buscar platillo, ingrediente o categoría..." onkeyup="filterMenu()">
        </div>

        <!-- Filter Tabs -->
        <div class="category-tabs">
            <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="filterCategory('all')">TODO</button>
            <button class="tab-btn" onclick="filterCategory('compartir')">PARA COMPARTIR</button>
            <button class="tab-btn" onclick="filterCategory('cortes')">CORTES SELECTOS</button>
            <button class="tab-btn" onclick="filterCategory('costillas')">COSTILLAS</button>
            <button class="tab-btn" onclick="filterCategory('alambres')">ALAMBRES & HAMBURGUESAS</button>
            <button class="tab-btn" onclick="filterCategory('entradas')">ENTRADAS & SOPAS</button>
            <button class="tab-btn" onclick="filterCategory('pollo')">POLLO</button>
            <button class="tab-btn" onclick="filterCategory('ensaladas')">ENSALADAS & ALITAS</button>
            <button class="tab-btn" onclick="filterCategory('bebidas')">BEBIDAS</button>
        </div>

        <!-- Category: PARA COMPARTIR -->
        <div class="category-block" data-category="compartir">
            <div class="category-header">
                <h3 class="category-title">TODO PARA COMPARTIR</h3>
                <p class="category-desc">Porque los mejores momentos se viven en la mesa</p>
            </div>
            <div class="dishes-grid">
                <div class="dish-card">
                    <div class="dish-info">
                        <h4>MOLCAJETE DE ARRACHERA <i class="fa-solid fa-fire"></i></h4>
                        <p>Arrachera, nopales, cebollitas y queso fundido en piedra volcánica ardiente. Para 2 personas.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dish-price">$375.00</div>
                </div>
                <div class="dish-card">
                    <div class="dish-info">
                        <h4>MOLCAJETE VIVA <i class="fa-solid fa-fire"></i></h4>
                        <p>Arrachera, chorizo y pollo con salsa de la casa, burbujeante. Para 2 personas.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dish-price">$410.00</div>
                </div>
                <div class="dish-card">
                    <div class="dish-info">
                        <h4>COMBO SENCILLO - 2 AGUAS</h4>
                        <p>1/2 kg de arrachera, frijoles charros, papas, cebollitas, chiles toreados, nopales, salsas, limones y 2 aguas.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dish-price">$350.00</div>
                </div>
                <div class="dish-card">
                    <div class="dish-info">
                        <h4>COMBO SENCILLO - 2 CERVEZAS</h4>
                        <p>1/2 kg de arrachera con todas las guarniciones y 2 cervezas.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dish-price">$370.00</div>
                </div>
                <div class="dish-card">
                    <div class="dish-info">
                        <h4>COMBO ARRACHELADA</h4>
                        <p>Arrachera, complementos y arrachelada de la casa para compartir.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dish-price">$520.00</div>
                </div>
                <div class="dish-card">
                    <div class="dish-info">
                        <h4>PARRILLADA VIVA</h4>
                        <p>Arrachera, costilla, chorizo argentino y pollo al carbón con todas las guarniciones.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dish-price">$345.00 <span style="font-size:0.6rem; color:#888;">desde</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Category: ENTRADAS, SOPAS Y CREMAS -->
        <div class="category-block" data-category="entradas">
            <div class="category-header">
                <h3 class="category-title">ENTRADAS, SOPAS Y CREMAS</h3>
                <p class="category-desc">Para abrir el apetito con calorcito</p>
            </div>
